---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
---
<style>
.hero-logo {
  max-width: 500px;     /* controls visual size */
  margin: 3rem auto 2rem;
}

.hero-logo img {
  width: 100%;          /* scales down to container */
  height: auto;         /* preserves aspect ratio */
  display: block;
}
</style>

<main>
<div class="hero-logo">
  <img src="/Assets/images/Logov2.png" alt="Sauceda's Security Stack logo">
</div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center;">Welcome</h1>
  
  <p>This is my personal cybersecurity portfolio and blog. Here you'll find writeups, reflections, and projects related to offensive security, CTFs, and my journey in cybersecurity.</p>
  
  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 2rem 0;">
    <a href="/terminal/" class="terminal-link">
      <span class="prompt">visitor@here:~$</span></span> click here to navigate this site through a terminal<span class="cursor-blink">█
    </a>
  </div>
  
  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">Recent Posts</h1>
  
  <div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); margin: 2rem 0;"></div>
  
  <div class="posts-list">
{% for post in collections.posts.slice(0, 3) %}
    <article class="post-preview">
      <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="date">{{ post.data.date | dateFormat }}</span>
        </div>
        {% if post.data.tags %}
          <div class="tags">
            {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
              {% if tag != "posts" %}
                <span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if post.data.summary %}
          <p class="excerpt">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;">
    <a href="/posts/" style="color: var(--accent-color); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.1rem;">View All Posts ></a>
  </div>
</main>

<style>
  .terminal-link {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .terminal-link:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  }
  
  .terminal-link .prompt {
    color: var(--accent-color);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .cursor-blink {
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
    color: var(--accent-color);
  }
  
  @keyframes blink {
    0%, 50% { opacity: 1; }
    51%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
  }
  
  .posts-list {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  
  .post-preview {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }
  
  .post-preview:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  
  .post-preview h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .post-preview h3 a {
    color: var(--text-color);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  .post-preview h3 a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-color);
  }
  
  .post-preview .meta {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .post-preview .date {
    color: var(--accent-color);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  .post-preview .tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .post-preview .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-color);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }
  
  .post-preview .excerpt {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
